      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>A Care Inspectorate visit is no surprise if you have already run it on yourself. In Scotland the Care Inspectorate regulates childminders. Ofsted is England only. The hard part is doing self-evaluation honestly, taking proof on the spot, and keeping the plan live.</p>"
    },
